:: Bailey HQ Outskirts
<<effects>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 1>>
	<<passoutstreet>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		You approach the sprawling warehouse complex surrounded by barbed wire fence. Activity is bustling inside as trucks unload their cargo into the external loading dock, workers traipse around the warehouse and trucks occasionally go in and out of the garage. There is only one entrace in or out and a manned security checkpoint stands watch.
	<<else>>
		You approach the sprawling warehouse complex surrounded by barbed wire fence. Activity is quiet inside, trucks are stationary at the external loading dock, the loading dock gates are closed and the garage door is closed. There is only one entrace in or out and a manned security checkpoint stands watch.	
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Approach the checkpoint|Bailey HQ Checkpoint]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Approach the barbed wire fence|Bailey HQ Barbed Wire Fence]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Checkpoint
<<effects>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 5>>
	<<passoutstreet>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		You sneak up as close as you can to it. The security checkpoint has one guard manning the radio in the guard post and two in charge of the road barrier. A truck driver's identity is being checked by one of the guards before the road barrier is lifted and the guard waves them inside.
	<<else>>
		You sneak up as close as you can to it. The security checkpoint has two guards manning the radio in the guard post and one on watch duty. The night is quiet, except for the occasional grumblings from the guard on duty.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<span class="yellow">There's no cover, you won't be able to sneak up on them and this will alert the entire complex.</span><br>
	<<link [[Charge at them|Bailey HQ Checkpoint Charge]]>><</link>><<dangerousText>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Bailey HQ Outskirts]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Barbed Wire Fence
<<effects>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 5>>
	<<passoutstreet>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		You approach as closely as possible to the barbed wire fence, occasionally spotting patrols monitoring the perimeter.
	<<else>>
		You stealthily approach the barbed wire fence, patrols are still doing their rounds with flashlights.
	<</if>>

	<br><br>

	<span class="yellow">There's no cover, you won't be able to sneak up on them and this will alert the entire complex.</span><br>
	<<link [[Charge at them|Bailey HQ Checkpoint Charge]]>><</link>><<dangerousText>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Bailey HQ Outskirts]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
